        "cooked": "<p>3) &nbsp;you count the hexes from 1 to the other, then add the difference in elevation. &nbsp;So with three hexes between them they are 4 hexes apart, and since they are at the same elvation, 4+0=4. &nbsp;Range of 4.</p>",
