        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lutherbellhendricksv/{size}/2350_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-23T12:46:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unity's bots aren't characters, but they are allies, and will be affected by anything that specifies allies. Also, Unity can't use tokens on her sheet for attack or defense rolls her bots make; they can only use their own tokens.</p><p>Rule of thumb -- if they're a target (i.e. they have hp), they make their own attacks, have their own tokens, etc. If they don't have hp (like Impaling Structure for instance), their character is the one making the attack.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:58:27.081Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
