        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Unity&#39;s bots aren&#39;t characters, but they are allies, and will be affected by anything that specifies allies. Also, Unity can&#39;t use tokens on her sheet for attack or defense rolls her bots make; they can only use their own tokens.</p><p>Rule of thumb -- if they&#39;re a target (i.e. they have hp), they make their own attacks, have their own tokens, etc. If they don&#39;t have hp (like Impaling Structure for instance), their character is the one making the attack.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
